026-02-26 08:35:53'),('4f8d6916-0a7c-4e49-b0b1-c2b32a43d1c0','7b8e0c87-3456-4c1b-9982-28c0e8ae94f4','assistant','## ต้องการข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\n\nข้อมูลที่ส่งมามีเพียงข้อมูลผู้ติดต่อ แต่ยังขาดรายละเอียดที่จำเป็นในการสร้าง Opportunity:\n\nกรุณาระบุ:\n1. **ชื่อบริษัทลูกค้า** — ต้องการค้นหาบริษัทที่มีอยู่แล้วหรือสร้างบริษัทใหม่?\n   - ถ้า新: ชื่อบริษัทเป็นอะไร?\n   - ซึ่งจากข้อมูลที่ให้มา `\"แนะนำ ไอที โซลูชั่น ที่ตลาด\"` อาจเป็นที่อยู่หรือลักษณะBusiness ช่วยยืนยันชื่อบริษัทโดยตรง\n2. **ชื่อ Opportunity** (เช่น \"พัฒนาแอปฯ\", \"ขายอุปกรณ์Server\")\n3. **Stage** (`lead` / `qualified` / `proposal` / `negotiation` / `won` / `lost`)\n4. **มูลค่า (บาท)** — ถ้าไม่ทราบให้ระบุ `0`\n\n---\n**รายละเอียดผู้ติดต่อที่ได้:**\n- ชื่อ: คุณโบ เจษฎา\n- เบอร์: 093-929-4454\n- ที่อยู่: แนะนำ ไอที โซลูชั่น ที่ตลาด\n- อีเมล: (ว่าง)\n\nหากคุณต้องการ ให้ฉัน**ค้นหาหรือสร้างบริษัท**ก่อน โปรดบอกชื่อบริษัทโดยตรงและที่อยู่/เบอร์ที่ต้องการบันทึกเพิ่มเติมครับ',NULL,'2026-06-12 07:54:25'),('4f904600-2514-442e-b695-08fe63cea707','141c1212-b747-48c8-a964-35ebafb2351e','user','1. PTA Migrate and Upgrade Domino to V14.5\n2. ใช้ตามนั้นเลย\n3. ไม่มี\n4. เริ่มวันนี้เสร็จวันนี้\n5. กลาง\n6. ฉันเอง\n\nและโปรเจคนี้ยังไม่มี สร้างใหม่ให้เลย',NULL,'2026-04-29 16:35:40'),('4fad11e1-1d2d-483b-be02-f2c91588cc1e','8a1d2387-c0bf-4820-8ad5-b324b5ac459c','user','บันทึกเวลาทำงาน ',NULL,'2026-03-02 09:05:41'),('5001f761-e1de-4d0d-b5dc-20ce9aab9f4c','4aa34f14-d9c5-4f42-881b-531efbcbac73','assistant','ค้นหาข้อมูลบริษัทจากอินเตอร์เน็ตและสร้างในระบบ\n\n✓ ค้นหาข้อมูลบริษัท rich precision tools จากอินเตอร์เน็ต: พบข้อมูล: rich precision tools\n✓ สร้างบริษัทในระบบ: สำเร็จ',NULL,'2026-02-27 07:58:58'),('5028c849-39d6-4672-bf25-98501c738d99','2131b0ec-1ee0-41b5-a2dc-a6e8a83027c7','user','แสดงโปรเจค Smart KPI',NULL,'2026-02-21 06:20:51'),('508b4106-58c2-4c31-a692-c800569de441','97356823-9348-470d-9300-38089e5c2599','user','ลากิจวันที่ 9 มีนาคม 8 ชั่วโมง',NULL,'2026-02-27 11:29:15'),('50ba3ab3-4df0-4438-bf59-069011ef94ce','43673465-7c86-45c4-aaea-2c5090fedcb0','user','งานทั้งหมดของทุกคนเมื่อวาน',NULL,'2026-05-16 07:24:15'),('50e9d8c4-3fdc-4a0c-8399-41226d6e4336','fd442abd-94f9-46ff-8cd1-b7845f6b4faf','assistant','กรุณาระบุรายละเอียดเพิ่มเติมดังนี้:\n\n1. **ชื่อโปรเจค** คืออะไร?\n2. **วันที่สิ้นสุด** ของโปรเจค (วันที่สุดท้ายที่ต้องทำเสร็จ)?\n3. **ลูกค้า/บริษัท** ที่เกี่ยวข้อง (ถ้ามี) คือบริษัทอะไร?\n4. มี **รายละเอียดอื่นๆ** เพิ่มเติมไหม เช่น คำอธิบายโปรเจค, วันที่เริ่มต้น, สถานะ?',NULL,'2026-02-20 19:39:35'),('5116990f-f956-4a03-9ede-77ce429f0acf','847dc412-16a7-48dc-a2ee-74e52cd9046e','user','สรุปบันทึกงานทั้งหมดที่กรอกสัปดาห์นี้',NULL,'2026-05-12 13:13:40'),('5158cc64-a503-4088-b5c5-1dad3b1c16bd','036f0c5e-900d-44a7-8f9b-caadabfd4a8e','assistant','สร้างบริษัทฉั่วฮะเส็งและผู้ติดต่อคุณโย\n\n✓ ค้นหาข้อมูลบริษัทฉั่วฮะเส็งจากอินเตอร์เน็ต: พบข้อมูล: ฉั่วฮะเส็ง\n✓ สร้างบริษัทฉั่วฮะเส็ง: สำเร็จ\n✓ สร้างผู้ติดต่อคุณโย: สำเร็จ',NULL,'2026-02-27 08:52:25'),('51862588-7dcc-4858-88b4-71defb3dc5c9','8daea4fa-f304-4895-bead-aac9ce385a04','user','กรมอุทยานแห่งชาติ สัตว์ป่า และพันธุ์พืช',NULL,'2026-02-27 08:11:48'),('5197dd7f-aa71-434c-9f8c-1965eb3b8388','5c0922ea-95b4-4f13-8630-8537e04a93c6','assistant','## สรุปผลลัพธ์ Query\n\n### ข้อมูลที่ได้:\n| ฟิลด์ | ค่า |\n|-------|-----|\n| **ID** | 54585e61-1018-47a6-b0cd-3150a03b9652 |\n| **User ID** | 4280b884-3d08-495f-a2fa-54b9547793b2 |\n| **วันที่** | 2026-02-25 |\n| **ชั่วโมงทำงาน** | 8.0 ชั่วโมง |\n| **ประเภทงาน** | work |\n| **รายละเอียดงาน** | งานพัฒนาระบบ Database Migration (Tiers 4-7) |\n| **Task** | ไม่มี (null) |\n| **Project** | ไม่มี (null) |\n\n### วิเคราะห์:\n- รายการนี้เป็น **Timesheet entry** ของวันที่ 25 กุมภาพันธ์ 2026\n- ทำงาน **8 ชั่วโมง** ในประเภท \"work\"\n- **ไม่มีการลิงก์กับ Task หรือ Project** (task_id เป็น null)\n- งานที่ทำเป็นการสร้าง **Database Migration Scripts** หลาย tiers:\n  - Tier 2: Template System Schema\n  - Tier 3: Context/Instructions Schema\n  - Tier 4: Credits Schema\n  - Tier 5: System Config Schema\n  - และมีต่อใน description (ถูกตัด截)','[{\"id\":\"54585e61-1018-47a6-b0cd-3150a03b9652\",\"user_id\":\"4280b884-3d08-495f-a2fa-54b9547793b2\",\"date\":\"2026-02-25\",\"hours_worked\":\"8.0\",\"work_type\":\"work\",\"description\":\"## 4. Tier 2: Template System Schema (02_templates.md)\\n\\n- [x] 4.1 Create `database\\/migrations\\/02_templates.sql` — `templates` table with all fields, CHECK constraints (type: system\\/organization\\/user, status: draft\\/active\\/archived), response_style, temperature, default_settings JSONB, indexes\\n- [x] 4.2 Add `template_pins` table — UNIQUE(user_id, template_id), ON DELETE CASCADE\\n- [x] 4.3 Add `template_usage_logs` table — FK to templates, indexes on template_id, user_id, used_at DESC\\n- [x] 4.4 Add `template_department_visibility` table — UNIQUE(template_id, department_id)\\n- [x] 4.5 Run `02_templates.sql` against PostgreSQL\\n\\n## 5. Tier 3: Context\\/Instructions Schema (03_context.md)\\n\\n- [x] 5.1 Create `database\\/migrations\\/03_context.sql` — `instructions` table with scope CHECK (7 values), type CHECK (manual\\/ai\\/system), status CHECK, is_auto_active, content TEXT (MVP free-text), indexes\\n- [x] 5.2 Add `instruction_blocks` table — type CHECK (role\\/goal\\/tone\\/format\\/example\\/rule\\/limitation), ON DELETE CASCADE (reserved for Phase 2, not used in MVP application code)\\n- [x] 5.3 Add `instruction_department_visibility` table — UNIQUE(instruction_id, department_id), ON DELETE CASCADE; mirrors `template_department_visibility` pattern; no rows = visible to whole org, rows present = only listed departments see it\\n- [x] 5.4 Run `03_context.sql` against PostgreSQL\\n- [x] 5.5 Create `database\\/seeds\\/03_instructions.sql` — insert system-scope and organization-scope sample instructions (scope=\'system\', scope_entity_id=NULL)\\n\\n## 6. Tier 4: Credits Schema (04_credits.md)\\n\\n- [x] 6.1 Create `database\\/migrations\\/04_credits.sql` — `credit_wallets` with GENERATED ALWAYS AS used_credits, XOR CHECK (chk_wallet_owner), remaining >= 0 CHECK, priority, type\\/status CHECK constraints\\n- [x] 6.2 Add `credit_usage_logs` table — FK to credit_wallet_id + ai_request_id + thread_id, amount_used, remaining_after, metadata JSONB, indexes\\n- [x] 6.3 Add `credit_transactions` table — audit ledger with transaction_type CHECK (purchase\\/usage\\/refund\\/bonus\\/admin_adjust\\/expired), balance_before, balance_after, tokens_used, cost_usd\\n- [x] 6.4 Run `04_credits.sql` against PostgreSQL\\n\\n## 7. Tier 5: System Config Schema (05_system.md)\\n\\n- [x] 7.1 Create `database\\/migrations\\/05_system.sql` — `pii_masking_configs` with UNIQUE(organization_id), operator CHECK, language CHECK, block_entity_types JSONB, monitor_entity_types JSONB, mask_entity_types JSONB, score_threshold, custom_recognizers JSONB\\n- [x] 7.2 Add `filter_logs` table — recognizer_name VARCHAR(100) (e.g. `PROFANITY`, `COMPETITOR_BRAND`), matched_text VARCHAR(500) (excerpt only), content_hash TEXT (SHA-256 of original — privacy by design), action_taken CHECK (\'blocked\', \'monitored\'), confidence_score DECIMAL(5,4); ON DELETE SET NULL on message_id\\n- [x] 7.3 Add `content_embeddings` table — vector(1536) column type (pgvector), entity_type CHECK (template\\/instruction\\/thread), UNIQUE(entity_type, entity_id)\\n- [x] 7.4 Run `05_system.sql` against PostgreSQL\\n\\n## 8. Tier 6\\/7: Extended Features Schema (07_extended.md)\\n\\n- [x] 8.1 Create `database\\/migrations\\/07_extended.sql` — `thread_session_locks` with uq_active_lock UNIQUE DEFERRABLE (thread_id, is_active), expires_at = locked_at + 180 seconds, indexes\\n- [x] 8.2 Add `thread_compactions` table — triggered_by CHECK (manual\\/auto), compacted_up_to_message_id FK, summary_tokens, original_tokens, model_used\\n- [x] 8.3 Add `image_generation_jobs` table — status CHECK (queued\\/processing\\/completed\\/failed), result_urls JSONB, size, count, seed, credits_used\\n- [x] 8.4 Add `voice_transcripts` table — input_method CHECK (\'browser_stt\', \'native_audio\'), transcript TEXT (NULL for Path A), voice_path TEXT (NULL for Path B), voice_deleted_at TIMESTAMP, confidence DECIMAL(5,4), is_final BOOLEAN, browser_engine VARCHAR(100), language VARCHAR(10); CHECK constraint: native_audio requires voice_path, browser_stt requires transcript\\n- [x] 8.5 Add `notifications` table — notification_type CHECK (\'credit_warning\', \'system_announcement\', \'login_alert\', \'project_invited\', \'general\'), title, message, reference_type VARCHAR(50) nullable, reference_id UUID nullable (polymorphic), data JSONB, is_read, read_at TIMESTAMP\\n- [x] 8.6 Add `pii_masking_logs` table — entity_type VARCHAR(100), placeholder TEXT (e.g. `<PERSON_0>`, `<PHONE_NUMBER_1>`), original_value_hash TEXT (SHA-256, never raw content), score DECIMAL(5,4), start_char INT, end_char INT, operator CHECK (\'replace\',\'hash\',\'redact\',\'encrypt\'); ON DELETE CASCADE on message_id\\n- [x] 8.7 Run `07_extended.sql` against PostgreSQL\\n\\n## 9. Database Utility Scripts\\n\\n- [x] 9.1 Create `scripts\\/migrate.ts` — Node script that runs all migration SQL files in order (00→07) using postgres.js\\n- [x] 9.2 Create `scripts\\/seed.ts` — Node script that runs all seed files\\n- [x] 9.3 Add `db:migrate` and `db:seed` to `package.json` scripts\\n- [x] 9.4 Create `database\\/migrations\\/rollback.sql` — drops all DEV_2 tables in reverse dependency order\\n\\n## 10. Sidebar — Wire to Real Thread Data\\n\\nThe sidebar currently uses hardcoded `chatHistory` and `pinnedChats` arrays. All of this must come from the DB.\\n\\n- [x] 10.1 Create `lib\\/actions\\/threads.ts` — `getThreads(userId)` returns `{ pinned: Thread[], recent: Thread[] }` split by is_pinned, ordered by last_message_at DESC, WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND archived_at IS NULL\\n- [x] 10.2 Add `createThread(params)`, `renameThread(id, title)`, `archiveThread(id)`, `deleteThread(id)`, `togglePinThread(id)` (reject if pinned count ≥ 5) to `threads.ts`\\n- [x] 10.3 Convert `LayoutContent` (or root layout) to async Server Component — pass thread list as prop to `Sidebar`\\n- [x] 10.4 Update `Sidebar.tsx` to accept `pinnedChats` and `recentChats` as props from server — remove all `chatHistory`\\/`pinnedChats` hardcoded constants\\n- [x] 10.5 Wire the context menu inside Sidebar (rename\\/archive\\/delete\\/pin) to call the respective Server Actions with `useTransition` + `router.refresh()`\\n- [x] 10.6 Wrap sidebar thread list section in `<Suspense>` fallback skeleton so it doesn\'t block render\\n- [x] 10.7 Wire Sidebar footer user profile — replace hardcoded \\\"สมชาย \\/ somchai@duckkit.ai\\\" with real data from `getCurrentUser()` (task 16.1); fetch in `SidebarWithData` server component and pass as prop to `Sidebar`\\n- [x] 10.8 Wire Sidebar footer credit bar — replace hardcoded \\\"5%\\\" with real remaining\\/total from `getUserCreditBalance()` (task 16.2); fetch in `SidebarWithData` and pass credit summary as prop; display `remainingCredits \\/ totalCredits` as percentage\\n\\n## 11. Chat Page — `app\\/chat\\/[id]\\/page.tsx`\\n\\nThe chat page currently loads `MOCK_CONVERSATION`. Beyond just replacing it with DB data, the spec (section 2.2–2.7) defines many interactive features.\\n\\n- [x] 11.1 Make `app\\/chat\\/[id]\\/page.tsx` an async Server Component — load thread row + messages array via `getMessages(threadId)` and render into existing `UserMessage`\\/`AIMessage` components\\n- [x] 11.2 Replace `MOCK_CONVERSATION` usage — remove import, pass real messages from DB as props to client component\\n- [x] 11.3 Wire the existing \\\"แก้ไขชื่อแชท\\\" modal save button to call `renameThread()` Server Action (currently only updates local state)\\n- [x] 11.4 **Model Selector** — Add a model selector dropdown\\/modal to `ChatInput` that loads active models from `ai_models` table, organized by provider (Tab 1) and by category stored in `features.category` JSONB (Tab 2: thinking\\/research\\/code\\/analysis\\/image); selected model stored in thread\'s `ai_model_id` via `updateThreadModel(threadId, modelId)` Server Action\\n- [x] 11.5 **Model Capability Badges** — display capability icons (Vision, Audio, Reasoning, etc.) next to model name in selector using `supports_vision`, `supports_streaming`, `features` JSONB fields from ai_models\\n- [x] 11.6 **Provenance Badge on AI messages** — show provider name, model name, latency_ms, total_cost, request_id from `ai_requests` row linked to the message via `ai_metadata` JSONB on hover\\/expand\\n- [x] 11.7 **AI Suggested Replies** — after each AI message, display up to 3 suggested follow-up prompts (call a lightweight AI endpoint or derive from message content); clicking a suggestion pre-fills the input\\n- [x] 11.8 **File Attachment** — wire the existing add-menu attachment flow: validate file type (PDF\\/DOCX\\/XLSX\\/CSV\\/PNG\\/JPG\\/MP3\\/TEXT\\/MD\\/HTML) and size (≤10MB) client-side; upload file to server; store file reference in `messages.attachments` JSONB array; show thumbnail for images and icon for documents\\n- [x] 11.9 **Voice Input** — implement voice recording in ChatInput: use `Web Speech API` (SpeechRecognition) for text-only models (Claude, GPT-4 text mode) → transcript goes into textarea; use `MediaRecorder` API for audio-capable models (Gemini) → audio blob attached as file; add mic button with recording indicator\\n- [x] 11.10 **Extended Thinking Mode toggle** — show toggle button in ChatInput only when selected model has `features.extended_thinking = true` (o1, o3, Claude Opus); store mode in thread features; pass `thinking: true` flag to AI API call\\n- [x] 11.11 **Web Search Mode toggle** — show toggle only when model has `features.web_search = true` (Perplexity, GPT-4+web); pass search flag to API call\\n- [x] 11.12 **Context Usage Bar** — calculate total tokens in thread from `messages.ai_metadata[].total_tokens` sum; display bar (green <60%, yellow 60-90%, red >90%) of used\\/100,000 tokens\\n- [x] 11.13 **Warning Banner at 60%** — when context usage ≥ 60%, show the yellow banner: \\\"⚠️ Context usage: 60%\\\" with [Compact Now] and [New Thread] buttons below the messages area\\n- [x] 11.14 **Warning Banner at 90%** — when context usage ≥ 90%, show red banner: \\\"🔴 Your next message will automatically compact the conversation.\\\" with [Compact Now] [New Thread]; auto-trigger compaction on next send\\n- [x] 11.15 **Instruction Selector in Chat** — add instruction area above textarea: Auto toggle (left) + Manual dropdown (right); load available instructions via `getInstructions()` action; clicking Auto starts AI question flow; selecting from dropdown applies instruction text to textarea (One-Way Rule: once set, lock mode per spec section 5.5)\\n- [x] 11.16 **Thread Session Lock indicator** — on thread open, call `acquireLock(threadId)` and if lock is held by another session show a non-blocking banner \\\"อุปกรณ์อื่นกำลังใช้งาน\\\" with [เข้าใช้งานทันที] force-takeover button; poll every 10 seconds to check lock status\\n\\n## 12. Home Page — `app\\/page.tsx`\\n\\n- [x] 12.1 Wire `StandardChatInput` — when user submits text from home page, call `createThread({ title: first 50 chars of message })` Server Action then navigate to `\\/chat\\/[newId]` and send first message\\n- [x] 12.2 Wire SuggestionCard click — each quick action card pre-fills the input with that suggestion text and focuses the textarea\\n- [x] 12.4 Replace hardcoded `AI_PROVIDERS` array in `Header.tsx` — load real providers + models from `getActiveModels()` and pass as prop; wire model selection to `updateThreadModel()` Server Action (reconcile with ChatPageClient `ModelSelectorModal` so both show same selected model)\\n- [x] 12.5 Replace hardcoded `AVAILABLE_CONTEXTS` array in `Header.tsx` — load real instructions from `getInstructions()` (task 15.1) and pass via prop or context; reconcile with `InstructionSelectorBar` in ChatPageClient so selection state is shared (not duplicated)\\n\\n## 13. History Page — `app\\/history\\/page.tsx`\\n\\nThe history page currently uses the `ALL_CHATS` constant from `constants-history.ts`.\\n\\n- [x] 13.1 Make `app\\/history\\/page.tsx` a Server Component — load threads via `getThreadsForHistory(userId)` (all non-deleted threads including archived, ordered by last_message_at DESC) passed as prop to a client component\\n- [x] 13.2 Replace `ALL_CHATS` and `HISTORY_FILTERS` constants — remove usage; derive pinned\\/today\\/yesterday\\/this-week grouping from real `last_message_at` timestamp at render time\\n- [x] 13.3 Wire `handlePinToggle` — replace `console.log` with `togglePinThread()` Server Action call\\n- [x] 13.4 Wire `handleRename` — replace `console.log` with opening rename modal that calls `renameThread()` Server Action\\n- [x] 13.5 Wire `handleDelete` — replace `confirm()` + `console.log` with proper confirm modal calling `deleteThread()` Server Action\\n- [x] 13.6 Add archive option in thread context menu → call `archiveThread()` Server Action; archived threads shown in \\\"เก็บถาวร\\\" section (filtered separately)\\n\\n## 14. Templates Page & Forms — `app\\/templates\\/`\\n\\nThe templates page currently uses the `TEMPLATES` constant. The spec (section 4) defines search, filter, stat badges, semantic search, and \\\"เริ่มแชท\\\" flow.\\n\\n- [x] 14.1 Create `lib\\/actions\\/templates.ts` — `getTemplates(params: { search?, type?, status?, provider?, organizationId })` queries templates JOIN ai_models JOIN ai_providers; filters by status=\'active\' for regular users; returns with usage_count, last_used_at, is_pinned (from template_pins for current user)\\n- [x] 14.2 Make `app\\/templates\\/page.tsx` a hybrid — Server Component loads initial template list + available filter options (distinct types\\/providers from DB); passes to client component for interactive filtering\\/search\\n- [x] 14.3 Replace `TEMPLATES` and `TEMPLATE_CATEGORIES` constants — remove usage; render real data from DB\\n- [x] 14.4 **Template Card data** — wire template cards to show: Status Badge (active\\/draft), Model Badge with provider name and provider color, Type Badge (system\\/organization\\/personal), version, usage_count, last_used_at, created by name\\n- [x] 14.5 **Keyword search** — filter by title ILIKE and description ILIKE (client-side for already-loaded data, or server-side refetch on debounce)\\n- [x] 14.6 **Semantic search** — when search query length >3 chars, also call a Server Action `semanticSearchTemplates(query)` that runs pgvector similarity on `content_embeddings` WHERE entity_type=\'template\'; merge results ranked by similarity\\n- [x] 14.7 **Category\\/Status\\/Provider filters** — fetch distinct categories\\/providers from DB as filter options instead of hardcoded `TEMPLATE_CATEGORIES`\\n- [x] 14.8 **Pin\\/Favorite toggle** — wire favorite\\/pin icon on template card to `pinTemplate(id)` \\/ `unpinTemplate(id)` Server Actions; reflect pinned state from template_pins query\\n- [x] 14.9 **\\\"เริ่มแชท\\\" button** — call `useTemplate(id)` Server Action: creates new thread with `instruction_mode=\'template\'`, sets `custom_instructions` from template content, records template_usage_logs, increments usage_count; then navigate to `\\/chat\\/[newId]`\\n- [x] 14.10 Wire `app\\/templates\\/new\\/page.tsx` form fields to DB: title, name, description, icon, AI Provider dropdown (from ai_providers), Model dropdown (filtered by selected provider from ai_models), language (th\\/en), response_style (formal\\/friendly\\/professional), temperature slider (0.0–1.0); call `createTemplate()` Server Action on submit\\n- [x] 14.11 Add **AI Generate instruction** button in new\\/edit template form — calls a Server Action `aiGenerateInstruction(prompt)` that calls AI API to generate a suggested instruction text; fills the instruction textarea with result\\n- [x] 14.15 Add **Block-based \\/ Free Text mode toggle** in TemplateForm System Instruction card — Block mode: block type buttons + BlockEditor list (reuse context components); Free Text mode: textarea + AI Generate button + loading overlay; `handleSubmit` resolves `system_instruction` from active mode\\n- [x] 14.12 Wire `app\\/templates\\/[id]\\/page.tsx` to load real template detail from `getTemplate(id)` — show usage stats, created by, version history\\n- [x] 14.13 Wire `app\\/templates\\/[id]\\/edit\\/page.tsx` (or edit route) to `updateTemplate()` Server Action\\n- [x] 14.14 Create `database\\/seeds\\/04_templates.sql` — insert 5+ system templates with real ai_model_id FK, instructions content, and metadata\\n\\n## 15. Context \\/ Instructions Page — `app\\/context\\/page.tsx`\\n\\nThe context page currently uses the `CONTEXTS` constant and has `console.log` stubs for save\\/generate.\\n\\n> **Architecture note:** Instructions are split into two classes. `instruction_class = \'policy\'` (auto-applied hierarchy, managed by Admin\\/DEV, NOT shown at `\\/context`) and `instruction_class = \'thread\'` (user-selectable per chat thread, shown at `\\/context`). See `design.md` Decision #7.\\n\\n- [x] 15.1 Create `lib\\/actions\\/instructions.ts` — `getInstructions(userId, orgId, deptId)` fetches instructions WHERE `instruction_class = \'thread\'` + status=\'active\' scoped to user\'s visibility; returns scope label, icon, usage_count, is_auto_active\\n- [x] 15.2 Make `app\\/context\\/page.tsx` a hybrid — Server Component loads instruction list; passes to client component for modal state management\\n- [x] 15.3 Replace `CONTEXTS` and `CONTEXT_FILTERS` constants — remove usage; render data from DB; filter tabs use \\\"ของฉัน\\\" (personal scope, owned by user) \\/ \\\"จากระบบ\\/Admin\\\" (org\\/dept\\/user\\/system scope) — NOT raw scope names\\n- [x] 15.4 Wire **Create\\/Edit modal** (`StandardContextModal`) `handleSaveContext` stub — replace `console.log` with `createInstruction(data)` or `updateInstruction(id, data)` Server Action; close modal and refresh list\\n- ~~[x] 15.5 Wire **AI Generate modal** (`AIGenerateModal`) `handleAIGenerate` stub — ยกเลิก: ตัดฟีเจอร์ AI สร้างบริบทออก~~\\n- ~~[x] 15.6 Wire **AI Generate modal** `handleSaveAIResult` stub — ยกเลิก: ตัดฟีเจอร์ AI สร้างบริบทออก~~\\n- [x] 15.7 Wire **View modal** (`ViewContextModal`) `handleViewContext` — pass real instruction object (from DB) to modal instead of mock context; show full content, scope badge, usage_count, last_used_at\\n- [x] 15.8 Add **Delete** action on context card — call `deleteInstruction(id)` Server Action (soft delete: status=\'inactive\')\\n- [x] 15.11 Add **Block-based \\/ Free Text mode toggle** in StandardContextModal — `ContextModalBlockManager` gains mode toggle pills; Free Text tab: textarea + AI Generate button (calls `aiGenerateInstruction`) + loading overlay; Block tab: existing BlockEditor flow; `ContextFormData` extended with `inputMode: \\\"blocks\\\"|\\\"freetext\\\"` and `freeText: string`; `handleSaveContext` in `ContextPageClient` resolves content from active mode; edit mode auto-detects mode from existing data\\n- [x] 15.9 Display **Usage Count** and **Scope badge** on ContextCard from real DB data; badge logic: scope=\'personal\' → \\\"ของฉัน\\\", other scopes → \\\"Admin\\\" or scope name\\n- [x] 15.10 Create `database\\/seeds\\/05_instructions.sql` — insert sample instructions for each scope level with correct `instruction_class` values\\n- [x] 15.12 Add `instruction_class` column to `instructions` table — `ALTER TABLE instructions ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS instruction_class VARCHAR(10) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'thread\' CHECK (instruction_class IN (\'policy\', \'thread\'))`; update migration `03_context.sql`; backfill: system\\/org\\/dept\\/user scope + is_auto_active=true → \'policy\'\\n- [x] 15.13 Update `getInstructions()` to filter `instruction_class = \'thread\'` only — ensures policy instructions never appear on `\\/context` page\\n- [x] 15.14 Add `getPolicyInstructions(userId, orgId, deptId)` Server Action — returns `instruction_class = \'policy\'` instructions ordered by scope priority (system=1, org=2, dept=3, user=4, personal=5) for AI merge pipeline\\n- [x] 15.15 Update `\\/context` page filter tabs — replace [\\\"ทั้งหมด\\\", \\\"ระบบ\\\", \\\"กำหนดเอง\\\", \\\"บทบาท\\\"] with [\\\"ทั้งหมด\\\", \\\"ของฉัน\\\", \\\"จากระบบ\\/Admin\\\"]; update `scopeToFilterLabel()` in `ContextPageClient.tsx`\\n- [x] 15.16 Update `DEV_2_V2\\/03_context.md` schema spec — add `instruction_class` column to field table + SQL block; fix Merge algorithm SQL to filter `instruction_class = \'policy\'` (removed obsolete `instruction_blocks` JOIN from merge example)\\n\\n## 16. Profile Page — `app\\/profile\\/page.tsx`\\n\\nThe profile page uses `MOCK_USER` and `MOCK_STATS`. Credit bar shows a single quota — the spec defines package + addon split.\\n\\n- [x] 16.1 Create `lib\\/actions\\/users.ts` — `getCurrentUser()` returns real user row (stub: hardcoded userId for MVP since no auth); `getUserStats(userId)` counts threads, projects, templates (type=\'user\'), instructions (personal scope) from DB\\n- [x] 16.2 Create `lib\\/actions\\/credits.ts` — `getUserCreditBalance(userId)` returns active wallets sorted by priority with remaining_credits and valid_until; `getCreditHistory(userId)` returns credit_usage_logs ordered by created_at DESC; `deductCredits(userId, amount, metadata)` implements FIFO with SELECT FOR UPDATE transaction; `createWallet(params)` calculates valid_until per spec D.3\\n- [x] 16.3 Make `app\\/profile\\/page.tsx` an async Server Component — replace `MOCK_USER` with `getCurrentUser()`, replace `MOCK_STATS` with `getUserStats()`\\n- [x] 16.4 Replace credit bar — instead of single `quota.used\\/quota.total`, render one bar split into two segments: package credits (priority=0, color: primary\\/yellow) + addon credits (priority=1, color: orange); show `packageRemaining + addonRemaining \\/ packageTotal + addonTotal` with labels for each type; expiry date from `valid_until`\\n- [x] 16.5 **Credit alert display** — if total remaining < 20% of total, show a warning badge \\\"⚠️ เครดิตเหลือน้อย\\\" in the credit card\\n- [x] 16.6 Replace StatCard values with real DB counts from `getUserStats()`\\n- [x] 16.7 Wire \\\"แก้ไขโปรไฟล์\\\" → `app\\/profile\\/edit\\/page.tsx` form to `updateUser()` Server Action (name, avatar upload)\\n- [x] 16.8 Create `database\\/seeds\\/06_credits.sql` — seed a package wallet (60 credits) and addon wallet (100 credits) for a demo user\\n\\n## 17. Projects Page — `app\\/projects\\/page.tsx`\\n\\n- [x] 17.1 Create `database\\/migrations\\/` addition or note: `projects` table is DEV1 scope — check if it exists; if not, create a minimal `projects` table (id, organization_id, created_by, name, description, status, cover_image_url, created_at, deleted_at) for MVP\\n- [x] 17.2 Create `lib\\/actions\\/projects.ts` — `getProjects(userId)`, `createProject(params)`, `updateProject(id, params)`, `archiveProject(id)`, `deleteProject(id)`\\n- [x] 17.3 Make `app\\/projects\\/page.tsx` a hybrid Server Component — load projects from `getProjects()` and replace `PROJECTS` constant\\n- [x] 17.4 Wire \\\"New Project\\\" form (at `app\\/projects\\/new\\/`) to `createProject()` Server Action with cover image upload (PNG\\/JPG ≤2MB, stored as URL)\\n- [x] 17.5 Wire project card status filter to DB status field (active\\/archived)\\n- [x] 17.6 Wire `app\\/projects\\/[id]\\/page.tsx` to load project threads: `getThreadsByProject(projectId)` — threads WHERE project_id = id AND deleted_at IS NULL\\n- [ ] 17.7 **Member management** in project detail — show member list with roles (Owner\\/Editor\\/Auditor); add `project_members` table (project_id, user_id, role); Server Actions: `addMember()`, `removeMember()`, `changeMemberRole()`\\n\\n## 18. Admin Providers & Models — `app\\/admin\\/providers\\/`\\n\\n- [x] 18.1 Create `lib\\/actions\\/admin\\/providers.ts` — `getProviders()` with model count per provider, `toggleProvider(id)`, `updateProvider(id, params)` (name, display_name, description, api_base_url, icon), `updateProviderApiKey(id, plainKey)` (encrypt with A