.2 (Admin_Notes_Designer_Installer) on Windows Server 2019\n- Notes Client 12.0.2 (Notes_Standalone_Standard_Installer) on Windows 10\n\n3. Domino Server version\n- 12.0.2 on Windows Server 2019\n\n4. OS details of the machine where Notes Client is installed.\n\n5. What kind of text message you are searching for?\n- document\n\n6. Is it a kind of custom application or notes built-in database? Please confirm (Assuming that the custom database only\n- Custom Application\n\n7. Is it a Single-user issue or a multiple-user issue?\n- All users\n\n8. Since, when you been facing this kind of error message?\n- After create index on this database. Because before enable result from search is not correct.\n\n9. Is this issue reproducible on demand? If yes, please provide the exact steps (assume the below screenshots are the same)\n- Just search.','incident','medium','closed','system',NULL,NULL,'Khun Somsak U.','','','<p>รันคอมมาน<br />\n<br />\nload compact -c<br />\nload fixup -f -j<br />\nload updall -R</p><ul><li>ผล: Yes</li><li>เวลาที่ใช้: 2.25</li><li>ผู้ดูแล: Nuttapong Ruttanakunaporn</li><li>ปิดงานโดย: Nuttapong Ruttanakunaporn</li></ul>',8,NULL,'2024-10-22 00:00:00','2024-10-22 00:00:00',NULL,'','user-001','2024-10-21 00:00:00','2026-06-27 13:32:27',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('e1d749c8-e340-4de4-b232-a6a76a8124ec','64FA949A831582F4472588D20031500D','tenant-default','M88D20031500D',NULL,'697ea62f-c321-4b73-b357-898e6223156b',NULL,NULL,'Server Express Down','Server Express Down','incident','medium','closed','walk-in',NULL,NULL,'ชนัตย์','Cell phone:0642833332','chanut.s@fufuthailand.com','<p>แนะนำไอทีให้เปลี่ยน HDD ใหม่</p><ul><li>ผล: Yes</li><li>เวลาที่ใช้: 8</li><li>ผู้ดูแล: Weerawat Suvonsaroch/Technical/KTNBS</li><li>ปิดงานโดย: Weerawat Suvonsaroch/Technical/KTNBS</li></ul>',8,NULL,'2022-10-05 00:00:00','2022-10-05 00:00:00',NULL,'','user-001','2022-09-15 00:00:00','2026-06-27 13:32:23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('e1f26fd5-8658-4358-8293-572e580db22a','213654E32F7F6F3D472587E300