_models.sql`:\n  ```sql\n  INSERT INTO ai_models (\n    id, provider_id, model_id, name, description, \n    context_window, max_output_tokens, input_price_per_1k, output_price_per_1k,\n    supports_vision, supports_streaming, supports_function_calling, supports_tool_calling,\n    status, features, created_at, updated_at\n  ) VALUES (\n    \'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbb9\',\n    \'aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaa9\', -- moonshot provider_id\n    \'moonshot/kimi-k2.5\',\n    \'Kimi K2.5\',\n    \'Kimi K2.5 model via Moonshot API - Advanced reasoning with vision and tool calling\',\n    256000,    -- context_window (maxInputTokens)\n    32768,     -- max_output_tokens\n    0.001,     -- input_price_per_1k (example pricing)\n    0.002,     -- output_price_per_1k (example pricing)\n    true,      -- supports_vision\n    true,      -- supports_streaming\n    true,      -- supports_function_calling\n    true,      -- supports_tool_calling\n    \'active\',\n    \'{\"category\": \"thinking\", \"thinking\": true, \"vision\": true, \"tool_calling\": true, \"extended_thinking\": true}\'::jsonb,\n    NOW(),\n    NOW()\n  );\n  ```\n- [x] 19.0.4 Run seed to add Moonshot provider and Kimi K2.5 model to database\n- [x] 19.0.5 Implement Moonshot API format in provider routing (OpenAI-compatible):\n  ```typescript\n  // POST http://192.168.1.44:8317/v1/chat/completions\n  {\n    \"model\": \"moonshot/kimi-k2.5\",\n    \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"...\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"...\"}],\n    \"stream\": true,\n    \"max_tokens\": 32768\n  }\n  ```\n- [x] 19.0.6 Test Moonshot connection: `curl http://192.168.1.44:8317/v1/models -H \"Authorization: Bearer 12345678\"`\n\n### 19.1-19.8 Core Message Pipeline\n- [x] 19.1 Create `lib/actions/messages.ts` — `getMessages(threadId)` returns messages WHERE deleted_at IS NULL ordered by sequence_number ASC\n- [x] 19.2 Implement `sendMessage(params)` Server Action: (1) insert user message row with sequence_number = MAX + 1, status=\'pending\'; (2) run Presidio pipeline if pii_masking_configs.pii_enabled OR filter_enabled; (3) if blocked → update message status=\'failed\', filter_status=\'blocked\', return error; (4) if masked → use masked content for AI; (5) call AI provider REST API using api_key_encrypted (decrypted in-memory); (6) insert AI response as assistant role message; (7) insert ai_requests row with token counts, cost, latency; (8) call deductCredits(); (9) update thread.last_message_at; (10) return both messages\n- [x] 19.3 **Presidio integration in sendMessage** — check pii_masking_configs for org; POST to `process.env.PRESIDIO_ANALYZER_URL + \'/analyze\'` (`http://192.168.1.72:5001/analyze`) with message content; evaluate entities against block_entity_types/mask_entity_types/monitor_entity_types with priority: block > monitor > mask; log to filter_logs; for masked: POST to `process.env.PRESIDIO_ANONYMIZER_URL + \'/anonymize\'` (`http://192.168.1.72:5002/anonymize`); log each masked entity to pii_masking_logs (store hash, never raw value)\n- [x] 19.4 **AI provider routing** — read provider from ai_models JOIN ai_providers; use api_base_url + api_config JSONB headers + decrypted api_key_encrypted; build correct request format per provider (OpenAI chat completions, Anthropic messages, Google generateContent); handle response to extract content + usage tokens\n- [x] 19.5 Wire `ChatInput` send button / Enter key to: (1) call `sendMessage()` Server Action for pre-processing (Presidio + insert user message row + return user message); (2) then open streaming connection to Route Handler for AI response (see 19.7); optimistic insert of user message bubble immediately on send\n- [x] 19.6 Update `last_message_at` in threads table after each successful AI response insertion\n- [x] 19.7 Create `app/api/chat/[threadId]/stream/route.ts` — POST Route Handler for streaming AI response: (1) read thread context from DB (latest `thread_compactions` summary + last 10 messages); (2) call AI provider API with streaming enabled (`stream: true`) using decrypted `api_key_encrypted` + provider-specific request format; (3) pipe tokens to client as Server-Sent Events: each token as `data: {\"token\": \"...\"}\\n\\n`, final event as `data: {\"done\": true, \"usage\": {prompt_tokens, completion_tokens, total_cost, response_time_ms}}\\n\\n`; (4) on stream end, insert AI assistant message row into `messages`, insert `ai_requests` row with token counts and latency, call `deductCredits()`, update `thread.last_message_at`; (5) return error SSE event `data: {\"error\": \"...\"}` on failure\n- [x] 19.8 Update `ChatInput` component to consume SSE stream — after pre-processing Server Action succeeds, POST to `/api/chat/[threadId]/stream`; read `response.body` as `ReadableStream`; decode each SSE `data:` chunk and append token to a live streaming message bubble; replace streaming bubble with final persisted message on `done` event; show typing indicator (animated dots) while streaming; handle `error` event gracefully with user-facing message','completed','medium','thitipan','4280b884-3d08-495f-a2fa-54b9547793b2','2026-02-26','2026-02-26',NULL,1,1,0,'task',100,5,1,1,'2026-02-26',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-02-26 17:31:42','2026-05-20 07:14:05',5.00,5.00,5.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('047888f9-181d-11f1-8816-b4a9fcd19bae','tenant-default','07262b08-2c19-4528-aec2-61d54d914b1d',NULL,'298a9bb8-2bcd-46ff-b2a8-705d6df61862','Work: คุยกับลูกค้า เรท บีท เรื่อง Support HW/SW ที่ลูกค้ามีอยู่','คุยกับลูกค้า เรท บีท เรื่อง Support HW/SW ที่ลูกค้ามีอยู่','completed','medium','Weerawat','298a9bb8-2bcd-46ff-b2a8-705d6df61862','2022-03-07','2022-03-07',NULL,1,1,0,'task',100,1,0,1,'2022-03-07',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-02-19 21:09:37','2026-05-20 07:14:05',0.50,0.50,0.50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('0478894b-181d-11f1-8816-b4a9fcd19bae','tenant-default','b8cb84d3-0696-4b6e-80da-ee46dcda98e3',NULL,'12658de5-2fc7-4555-9dff-b95175d9e387','Work: ReadCourse ออกแบบหน้าแ