ง\" retry button on error + call `clearMessageError()` on click\n- [x] 19.9.6 Error persists across page refresh via DB `messages.status=\'failed\'` (SSR initialization from getMessages)\n- [x] 19.9.7 Hide \"สร้างใหม่\" button in MessageBubble component with `hidden` Tailwind class\n\n## 19.5 Auto Instruction Flow — AI Question Pipeline\n**Note:** This implements the \"Auto\" mode from task 11.15 where AI asks questions to auto-generate instruction\n\n- [x] 19.5.1 Create `lib/actions/auto-instruction.ts` — `startAutoInstructionFlow(threadId, userId)`:\n  - Insert system message: \"กรุณาตอบคำถามต่อไปนี้ 3-5 ข้อ เพื่อให้ AI เข้าใจบริบทที่คุณต้องการ\"\n  - Generate first question using AI: \"คุณต้องการให้ AI ช่วยเหลือเรื่องอะไร? (เช่น เขียนโค้ด, วิเคราะห์ข้อมูล, สรุปเนื้อหา)\"\n  - Store flow state in `thread.auto_instruction_state` JSONB: `{step: 1, answers: [], questions: [], isComplete: false}`\n  - Return {question, step, totalSteps}\n\n- [x] 19.5.2 Create `submitAutoInstructionAnswer(threadId, answer)` Server Action:\n  - Read current flow state from thread\n  - Append answer to `answers` array\n  - If step < 3 → generate next contextual question using AI based on previous answers\n  - If step >= 3 → call `completeAutoInstructionFlow()`\n  - Return {nextQuestion|null, step, isComplete}\n\n- [x] 19.5.3 Create `completeAutoInstructionFlow(threadId)` Server Action:\n  - Send all Q&A to AI with prompt: \"สร้าง instruction ที่ชัดเจนสำหรับ assistant จากคำตอบเหล่านี้...\"\n  - Generated instruction format: {role, goal, tone, format}\n  - Save to `instructions` table with:\n    - scope=\'personal\', scope_entity_id=userId\n    - type=\'ai\'\n    - instruction_class=\'thread\'\n    - generated_from_auto=true\n    - source_answers JSONB (the Q&A that generated it)\n  - Update thread: instruction_mode=\'manual\', selected_instruction_id=newId\n  - Return {instruction, instructionId}\n\n- [x] 19.5.4 Create `skipAutoInstruction(threadId)` Server Action:\n  - Mark flow as cancelled\n  - Reset thread to instruction_mode=null\n  - Allow user to select manual instruction instead (One-Way Rule: once skipped auto, can only choose manual)\n\n- [x] 19.5.5 Implement Auto Instruction UI components:\n  - `AutoInstructionModal` — shows current question with progress indicator (ข้อ 1/5)\n  - Textarea for answer with จำกัด 500 ตัวอักษร\n  - [ข้าม] button → calls skipAutoInstruction\n  - [ตอบ] button → calls submitAutoInstructionAnswer\n  - Shows loading state while AI generates next question\n\n- [x] 19.5.6 Wire Chat UI Auto toggle to `startAutoInstructionFlow()`:\n  - On toggle ON → call startAutoInstructionFlow, show AutoInstructionModal\n  - Lock other instruction controls (One-Way Rule enforcement)\n  - Show banner \"โหมด Auto: AI กำลังถามคำถามเพื่อสร้างบริบท\"\n\n- [x] 19.5.7 Sample questions flow (contextual based on first answer):\n  - Q1: \"คุณต้องการให้ AI ช่วยเหลือเรื่องอะไร?\"\n  - Q2 (ถ้าตอบ coding): \"ภาษาโปรแกรมอะไร? มี framework ที่ต้องการไหม?\"\n  - Q3: \"ผลลัพธ์ที่คาดหวังเป็นแบบไหน? (สั้นกระชับ / ละเอียดพร้อมตัวอย่าง)\"\n  - Q4: \"มีข้อจำกัดหรือข้อควรระวังอะไรไหม?\"\n  - Q5: \"ใครเป็นคนอ่านผลลัพธ์นี้? (เทคนิค / ทั่วไป / ผู้บริหาร)\"\n\n- [x] 19.5.8 Test Auto Instruction end-to-end:\n  - Start new thread → select Auto mode\n  - Answer 3-5 questions\n  - Verify AI-generated instruction is saved\n  - Verify instruction is auto-applied to thread\n  - Send test message to verify instruction works\n\n## 20. Context Compaction — `app/chat/[id]/`\n\n- [x] 20.1 Create `lib/actions/compaction.ts` — `compactThread(threadId, triggeredBy: \'manual\'|\'auto\')`: (1) load all non-compacted messages; (2) send messages 1..N-10 to AI with prompt \"summarize this conversation\"; (3) insert thread_compactions row with summary_text, summary_tokens, original_tokens, model_used; (4) mark compacted messages with is_compacted=true; (5) return new token count estimate\n- [x] 20.2 In `sendMessage()` — before calling AI, sum `ai_metadata.total_tokens` across all messages in thread; if ≥90,000, auto-call `compactThread(id, \'auto\')` first; pass summary + last 10 messages as context\n- [x] 20.3 In `sendMessage()` — calculate context_usage_pct = total_tokens / 100,000; return this value alongside message response so client can update the context bar\n- [x] 20.4 Wire \"Compact Now\" button in chat UI warning banner to call `compactThread(id, \'manual\')` Server Action and refresh context bar\n- [x] 20.5 Wire \"New Thread\" button in warning banner to `createThread()` and navigate to new thread','completed','medium','thitipan','4280b884-3d08-495f-a2fa-54b9547793b2','2026-03-02','2026-03-02',NULL,1,1,0,'task',100,8,1,1,'2026-03-02',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-03-02 17:32:43','2026-05-20 07:14:05',8.00,8.00,8.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('047f96f1-181d-11f1-8816-b4a9fcd19bae','tenant-default','8707bbbf-eae5-429c-8c12-ec5221db0fb2','5a37e056-8226-4d7b-abec-72f286fb5357','4280b884-3d08-495f-a2fa-54b9547793b2','Work: ENV-MAN','ENV-MAN','completed','medium','thitipan','4280b884-3d08-495f-a2fa-54b9547793b2','2024-10-15','2024-10-15',NULL,1,1,0,'task',100,8,1,1,'2024-10-15',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-02-19 21:08:27','2026-05-20 07:14:05',8.00,8.00,8.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('047f976c-181d-11f1-8816-b4a9fcd19bae','tenant-default','07262b08-2c19-4528-aec2-61d54d914b1d',NULL,'17c17a5b-c3a8-4641-859f-4ed84853011e','Work: Vogue Survey IT Support','Vogue Survey IT Support','completed','medium','thanadol','17c17a5b-c3a8-4641-859f-4ed84853011e','2024-01-31','2024-01-31',NULL,1,1,0,'task',100,3,0,1,'2024-01-31',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-02-19 21:08:39','2026-05-20 07:14:05',3.00,3.00,3.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('047f97bc-181d-11f1-8816-b4a9fcd19bae','tenant-default','07262b08-2c19-4528-aec2-61d54d914b1d',NULL,'17c17a5b-c3a8-4641-859f-4ed84853011e','Work: หาโปรแกรม ของ Vogue','หาโปรแกรม ของ Vogue','completed','medium','thanadol','17c17a5b-c3a8-4641-859f-4ed84853011e','2024-04-02','2024-04-02',NULL,1,1,0,'task',100,3,0,1,'2024-04-02